; printer_notes = Don't remove the following keywords! These keywords are used in the compatible printer condition of the print and filament profiles.\nPRINTER_VENDOR_RAISE3D\nPRINTER_MODEL_PRO2PLUS_HS\nPRINTER_VARIANT_DUAL\nEXPERIMENTAL\nNot production-ready. Hyper Speed / Klipper Pro2 Plus dual electronic-lift heads.\nLeft-only purge from ideaMaker conradfreeman_filament_orange.gcode. Dual start, standby tool-change, and end from Multicolor.gcode. XY nozzle offset is firmware (factory 25 mm X) — slicer offset is 0 so it is not applied twice. Wipe tower position/shape is PrusaSlicer's (relative E / M83); do not copy ideaMaker tower XY. Stage 6-7 physical tests still required.
